amisup/lvodos.a68 *jd 12/4/90:
	changed all equate values from positive to negative

stdio/format.c *jd 12/10/90:
	changed rounding array used by ldtoa to add another element.
	and changed ldtoa to correct rounding bug. (bug3.c)

	moved last 'if' statement in ldtoa to correct 0 truncation bug in
	'g' conversion. (bug7.c)

LIBSCR 1: jd 4/29/91 misc/setlocal.c:
	changed setlocale so that its second arg can be null to fetch
	current locale

LIBSCR 2: jd 5/9/91 sysio/fexec.c:
	_doexec was trashing d2, but that was being used as a register var by
	fexecv when optimizing was used.

glue20/asl/#?
