		glue for AllocAslRequest was popping args into the wrong regs
		and calling the wrong offset into asl.library

		glue for AslRequest was calling the wrong offset into asl.library

		glue for FreeAslRequest was calling the wrong offset into asl.library

	Created glue for amiga.lib-only routines:
		AllocAslRequestTags
		AslRequestTags

	Deleted glue for obsolete asl.library routines:
		AddDlistItems, AllocFontRequest, CreateDList, DrawDList,
		EmptyDList, FreeDList, FreeFontRequest, GetDListInfo,
		HandleDListEvent, RefreshDListProp, RefreshDList, RequestFont,
		ScrollDListAbs, ScrollDList

	inp/c#?.inp
		made changes to glue20/asl entries for above reasons

