inp/c#?.inp				9/5/91
	There were different glue routines for AllocMiscResource and 
	FreeMiscResource in glue20/misc and amisup subdirectories, and both
	versions were in the c libraries. The glue20/misc routines followed
	C='s glue routines, which were incorrect. The amisup routines, which
	according to C= are correct, assume that the value that's to be loaded
	into A6 is passed in as the first argument.
	 The glue20/misc routines were removed from c#?.lib

scr/#?	9/10/91
	Modified all the scr_... functions for 5.0 compatibility
	(i.e. prototypes)

scr/scr_curs.c	9/10/91
	Modified scr_curs() to call write, not printf, to avoid mixing
	buffered and unbuffered i/o

scr/scr_tab.c	9/10/91
	scr_tab module in all variants of s.lib was empty

string/strnicmp.a68	9/11/91
	strnicmp crashed programs because it was accessing stack args in wrong
	place, and was not popping a register that it pushed before returning

stdio/_format.c
	printf("%g", 1e10) printed 1e-01
