m#?/ldexp	9/11/91
	changed all ldexp's to return 0 on underflow instead of -HUGEVAL

mx_ieee/sqrt	9/11/91
	changed sqrt to detect ldexp's returning 0, and have sqrt return 0

time/strftime	9/12/91
	%p option changing from AM to PM at 11am

sysio/stat	9/12/91
	stat() returns time as seconds since 1/1/78, while ctime() is passed
	seconds since 1/1/70. Instead of changing stat, we added a #define of
	TIME_MCH2AZTEC to stat.h and time.h that adjusts st_mtime to 
	time_t format.

time/localtim.c	9/13/91
	changing localtim() to set tm_isdst to -1, since we don't know if it's
	daylight savings time or not. Need to add support for long form of
	TZ environment variable.

time/gmtime		9/13/91
	In order to get gmtime to work, you need to mset an environment variable
	named TZ:
		mset TZ=EST5EDT
	Aztec doesn't yet support the long form for TZ:
		TZ=EST5:00:00EDT4:00:00;117/2:00:00,299/2:00:00
	where
		   EST = 		time zone code
		   5:00:00 = 	offset to GMT for normal time
		   EDT			daylight savings time code
		   4:00:00 = 	offset to GMT for DST
		   117/2:00:00 =day of year/time on which DST begins
		   229/2:00:00 =day of year/time on which DST ends


sysio/_ioctl.c	9/16/91
	modified _ioctl() to work with windows any windows that a process
	opens, not just a cli window.

sysio/segload.a68 9/16/91 Rene' Vega
